1
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:12,600
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,760
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,300
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,830
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:26,270
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:30,110
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:37,170
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,390
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:43,910
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:47,070
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:50,200
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,560
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:57,320
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,610 --> 00:01:00,480
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,100
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,810
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:07,410
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:08,690
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,470
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:13,880
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:17,040
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:20,560
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:23,720
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:26,980
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:29,040
♪I travel north and south, witnessing
the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,870 --> 00:01:32,520
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:36,120
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,130 --> 00:01:39,600
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,880
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:45,720
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,840
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:52,960
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:57,000
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 24=

34
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:00,960
How did we end up back here again?

35
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:01,960
Three-Headed Jiao

36
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:03,440
(Double Happiness)
used his demonic power again.

37
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:04,500
Something must've gone wrong

38
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:05,300
with him and Ling'er too.

39
00:02:05,300 --> 00:02:06,920
So everything started over again.

40
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:08,560
But that's perfect.

41
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:11,120
It gives us another chance.

42
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,040
(Li Xiuyuan,)

43
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:15,680
(you are Dragon-Subduing Arhat reborn.)

44
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,400
(If you can...)

45
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:26,920
Shut up!

46
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:27,680
Wait here.

47
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:37,400
Take this.

48
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,960
I already took out the villain.

49
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:41,240
Please stop getting in our way.

50
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:41,560
Oh?

51
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:43,960
You skipped the whole plot

52
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:44,960
and killed him?

53
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,600
Now

54
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:48,520
all of Heaven's unfinished business

55
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,560
can never be resolved.

56
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:51,720
You're done for.

57
00:02:57,720 --> 00:02:58,840
- Xiuyuan!
- Yanzhi!

58
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:00,320
Yanzhi!

59
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:01,080
Yanzhi!

60
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:01,960
No!

61
00:03:03,100 --> 00:03:04,240
No!

62
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:09,920
You there!

63
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,560
A freshly caught fox!

64
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:13,560
Come take a look!

65
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:14,720
Here's your money.

66
00:03:23,500 --> 00:03:24,360
Darling.

67
00:03:26,160 --> 00:03:28,160
You don't need to fear that old fox now.

68
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:29,880
Pervert!

69
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:32,560
Hey!

70
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,160
Hey!

71
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,160
Again!

72
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,120
We're back again.

73
00:03:40,200 --> 00:03:42,480
Darling!

74
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:47,360
This time, I saved my wife

75
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:49,040
and helped her cultivate a human form.

76
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:50,560
I worked hard and earned money.

77
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:53,520
At last, we had a peaceful life.

78
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,640
Darling, I'm home!

79
00:03:57,760 --> 00:03:58,560
Darling?

80
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,160
Darling?

81
00:04:01,920 --> 00:04:03,040
Darling, what's wrong?

82
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:04,760
It's nothing.

83
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:06,440
I've just been

84
00:04:06,640 --> 00:04:07,440
a little tired lately.

85
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,600
I'll be fine after some rest.

86
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:12,920
Darling?

87
00:04:15,440 --> 00:04:16,240
Darling!

88
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:18,160
Darling!

89
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:20,640
Darling!

90
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:24,160
Again!

91
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,360
Back again?

92
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:31,920
I'm going to get rich!

93
00:04:36,779 --> 00:04:38,675
(Wanpi Bureau)

94
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:43,240
I finally found Wanpi Bureau's treasure!

95
00:04:49,210 --> 00:04:50,480
Good day, sir.

96
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:54,720
This time,

97
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:56,280
using the information I brought,

98
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:57,680
I finally found the treasure.

99
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:59,840
I'll never be apart from my wife again.

100
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:01,080
Exactly. This time,

101
00:05:01,080 --> 00:05:02,520
thanks to my genius plan,

102
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:03,800
I'll straighten things out with Heaven

103
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:06,280
and bring Yanzhi to Lingyin Temple.

104
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:07,400
This time,

105
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:09,200
nothing will go wrong.

106
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:11,240
Help!

107
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:12,560
Help!

108
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,080
Help!

109
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,840
What's going on?

110
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:19,720
- Help! A demon!
- A demon!

111
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:23,840
Hahaha!

112
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:31,240
Rotten monk!

113
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:33,600
I've taken control of your wife.

114
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:34,600
If you want to stop me,

115
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,920
you'll have to kill her first.

116
00:05:41,520 --> 00:05:42,160
Master!

117
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:44,360
- Master!
- Demon!

118
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:44,920
Help!

119
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:45,800
Save me!

120
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:46,920
Demon!

121
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:48,280
Let them go!

122
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:49,080
Come on!

123
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:50,520
Do it!

124
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,520
Attack, and your wife dies first.

125
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:54,640
I'll kill...

126
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:05,200
Darling!

127
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:08,760
You...

128
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:12,880
Enough yelling!

129
00:06:12,880 --> 00:06:13,720
What are you yelling for?

130
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:15,000
Here's the truth.

131
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:17,040
I've been sick of your face for ages.

132
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:18,880
All you do is cling to me.

133
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:19,680
Now,

134
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:20,840
just seeing you makes me sick.

135
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,440
Since we're at this point,

136
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:23,840
either divorce me

137
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:25,120
and give me half your property,

138
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:25,520
or

139
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,120
pretend you saw nothing

140
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:28,440
and get out!

141
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,880
Don't get in my way.

142
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:37,280
You...

143
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,400
Master!

144
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:45,440
Save me!

145
00:06:45,880 --> 00:06:46,320
Biqing!

146
00:06:46,440 --> 00:06:47,040
Master!

147
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:48,680
You...

148
00:06:58,440 --> 00:06:58,720
Darling...

149
00:06:58,720 --> 00:06:59,000
You...

150
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,040
Dragon-Subduing Arhat!

151
00:07:01,240 --> 00:07:03,120
I've suppressed the demon's power.

152
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:05,000
Do it now!

153
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:05,600
No!

154
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:06,550
If, even this time,

155
00:07:06,551 --> 00:07:07,880
we still can't be together,

156
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:10,240
I don't know what else I can do.

157
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:11,480
No.

158
00:07:11,640 --> 00:07:12,760
Don't let me

159
00:07:12,760 --> 00:07:14,640
put everyone else in danger.

160
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:16,080
Even if we could be together,

161
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:17,320
I could never be happy.

162
00:07:17,320 --> 00:07:18,600
Do it!

163
00:07:19,231 --> 00:07:19,678
You...

164
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,120
Rotten monk!

165
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:28,280
I knew you couldn't do it.

166
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:29,800
I win this time.

167
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:30,720
Die!

168
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:38,800
Arhat Heaven-Turning Seal!

169
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,280
Darling!

170
00:07:58,960 --> 00:07:59,680
Darling!

171
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:05,960
Darling!

172
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:09,120
My dear...

173
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:17,920
What more do you want from me?

174
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:22,760
Xiuyuan.

175
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:27,200
We've...

176
00:08:29,760 --> 00:08:31,840
been through this so many times.

177
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:34,120
But

178
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:38,520
we still can't be together.

179
00:08:40,040 --> 00:08:40,880
Don't...

180
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:46,640
Don't you understand yet?

181
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:01,360
Darling...

182
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,120
I understand now.

183
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:22,760
Darling.

184
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:26,360
Darling!

185
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:35,680
Holy Monk!

186
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:36,200
Master!

187
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:37,960
How come you two are fine?

188
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:40,080
Lüdie only cares about her husband,

189
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:42,680
and you're the only one I care about,
Master.

190
00:09:42,680 --> 00:09:44,360
So of course we were fine.

191
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,160
Holy Monk,

192
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:48,240
why weren't you affected
by the demonic energy?

193
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:49,000
Me?

194
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:51,520
Three-Headed Jiao's demonic energy

195
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:53,640
can send people back in time,

196
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:57,120
but their own obsession traps them.

197
00:09:57,160 --> 00:09:59,520
Once they let go,

198
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:01,280
it can't affect them.

199
00:10:01,520 --> 00:10:02,040
By the way,

200
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,520
where's Celestial Maiden Yanzhi?

201
00:10:04,520 --> 00:10:06,360
She was going to come with us,

202
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:08,360
but I knew if she came,

203
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,960
you'd worry about her safety.

204
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:11,960
So I sent her to Lingyin Temple.

205
00:10:12,520 --> 00:10:13,600
Piaopiao,

206
00:10:13,760 --> 00:10:15,120
you've finally grown up.

207
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:16,480
Dragon-Subduing Arhat!

208
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:18,000
We've got big trouble!

209
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:21,360
The Jade Emperor was feeding
Her Majesty grapes

210
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:22,960
when demonic energy came from nowhere.

211
00:10:23,040 --> 00:10:25,080
Then he suddenly disappeared!

212
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:26,120
Turns out

213
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:28,160
he went back in time

214
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:30,240
to find the woman he loves!

215
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:33,240
Her Majesty is furious.

216
00:10:33,240 --> 00:10:34,520
She's coming here

217
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:37,080
to confront Three-Headed Jiao

218
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:39,520
about who the Jade Emperor really loves.

219
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:41,720
Go bring the Jade Emperor back!

220
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,120
Or

221
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:43,320
when Her Majesty gets here,

222
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:46,040
we'll all be in serious trouble!

223
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:47,120
No!

224
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:49,520
Why is this happening?

225
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:52,040
Three-Headed Jiao, snap out of it!

226
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,640
Even if you go back in time,

227
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:55,880
you won't find happiness.

228
00:10:58,160 --> 00:10:59,240
Why is this happening?

229
00:11:00,160 --> 00:11:01,960
No matter what I change,

230
00:11:02,640 --> 00:11:04,440
I can't get the ending I want.

231
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:06,720
Stop being such a fool, will you?

232
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:08,480
Even I figured it out.

233
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:10,840
Why can't you?

234
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:12,680
No matter how many times you go back,

235
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:15,760
you'll never get a perfect ending.

236
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:18,520
No matter how many times I try,

237
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:21,760
I just want to be with Ling'er.

238
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:25,320
I know how you feel.

239
00:11:25,500 --> 00:11:27,880
You never got to truly be with her,

240
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,320
so you can't let go.

241
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,760
That regret became an obsession.

242
00:11:31,160 --> 00:11:32,760
But when it comes to love,

243
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:33,680
most stories

244
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,560
end in heartbreak.

245
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:40,480
If you keep this up,

246
00:11:40,520 --> 00:11:41,266
you may even lose

247
00:11:41,267 --> 00:11:42,760
the affection she still has for you.

248
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:43,360
Besides,

249
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:44,960
every time you show up,

250
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:46,520
you change her fate.

251
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:54,600
(This is the price.)

252
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:56,880
(Pervert!)

253
00:12:01,040 --> 00:12:01,840
(Darling!)

254
00:12:02,920 --> 00:12:03,880
(Darling!)

255
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:08,920
Listen,

256
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:11,080
it's all part of fate.

257
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:11,960
Right now,

258
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:13,640
this is the best outcome.

259
00:12:13,920 --> 00:12:15,480
As long as you keep living,

260
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:18,400
Heaven will bring you together again.

261
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:19,840
Do you understand?

262
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:22,280
I don't understand.

263
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:29,080
I just want to be with Ling'er.

264
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:32,120
Then I'll beat some sense into you.

265
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,000
Piaopiao!

266
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:04,080
Thunder God!

267
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:05,320
What are you waiting for?

268
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:11,440
Arhat Heaven-Turning Seal!

269
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:18,100
Master!

270
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:19,440
Where did you all go?

271
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:21,720
Celestial Maiden!

272
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:25,440
Dragon-Subduing Arhat!

273
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:28,960
You're okay!

274
00:14:29,040 --> 00:14:30,240
- Thank goodness!
- Thank goodness!

275
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:31,600
Master,

276
00:14:32,040 --> 00:14:32,720
last night, we were

277
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:34,280
enjoying the fireworks
with Master Guangliang and the others.

278
00:14:34,280 --> 00:14:35,200
Then suddenly,

279
00:14:35,200 --> 00:14:36,640
they vanished.

280
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:38,240
Just vanished.

281
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,360
Gone.

282
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:40,840
Gone.

283
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:41,600
All right, enough.

284
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:42,840
You really are pitiful.

285
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:45,000
You don't even have anyone you long for.

286
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:52,200
Master!

287
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:53,640
You're finally back!

288
00:14:53,640 --> 00:14:54,400
Get off me!

289
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,680
How did this happen?

290
00:14:58,160 --> 00:14:58,960
Well, you see...

291
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:00,920
You see...

292
00:15:01,577 --> 00:15:02,537
Well...

293
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:03,265
The thing is,

294
00:15:03,266 --> 00:15:05,560
you were under a demon's spell,

295
00:15:05,560 --> 00:15:08,880
and I rescued you.

296
00:15:08,880 --> 00:15:09,680
You rescued me?

297
00:15:09,680 --> 00:15:10,400
That's right.

298
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:13,560
I was perfectly happy with Biqing.

299
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:16,480
Why did you bring me back?

300
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:24,360
Arhat Heaven-Turning Seal!

301
00:15:26,256 --> 00:15:27,796
(Bonus scene ahead)

302
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:36,840
Done.

303
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:39,720
- Master!
- Huh?

304
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:43,160
Since when do you play with clay figures?

305
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:44,920
Clay figures, my foot!

306
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:46,200
This is Ke Ayao.

307
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:47,440
Shen Lang.

308
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:50,080
(Fortune Teller)
Su Ling'er and Three-Headed Jiao.

309
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:53,320
Why are you arranging them?

310
00:15:54,880 --> 00:15:55,800
Actually,

311
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:57,040
the Jade Emperor

312
00:15:57,320 --> 00:15:59,400
went back to when he first met
Her Majesty.

313
00:15:59,400 --> 00:16:00,760
When Her Majesty found out,

314
00:16:00,760 --> 00:16:01,680
she was overjoyed

315
00:16:01,680 --> 00:16:03,160
and plans to grant a general amnesty.

316
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:04,560
So Dragon-Subduing Arhat

317
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:05,650
naturally wants to

318
00:16:05,650 --> 00:16:07,800
have them reunited in their next lives.

319
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:13,720
Aren't you going to eat?

320
00:16:16,500 --> 00:16:17,250
If you don't hurry,

321
00:16:17,250 --> 00:16:18,160
the abbot will eat it all!

322
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:21,080
The abbot eats even more now?

323
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:22,600
He's always eaten this much.

324
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:23,520
This is all your fault!

325
00:16:23,520 --> 00:16:25,120
You donated all our money.

326
00:16:25,120 --> 00:16:26,600
Lingyin Temple is broke now.

327
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:27,920
We only get one meal a day.

328
00:16:27,920 --> 00:16:29,360
- Hurry up!
- We're fine.

329
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:30,800
How about we go on a diet?

330
00:16:30,920 --> 00:16:31,800
A diet?

331
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:33,360
What's that?

332
00:16:33,480 --> 00:16:34,680
Never heard of it.

333
00:16:34,680 --> 00:16:35,280
Seriously.

334
00:16:35,497 --> 00:16:36,137
Honestly.

335
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:37,680
At least eat something.

336
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:39,600
You need energy to lose weight!

337
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:40,560
Come on, let's go.

338
00:16:40,760 --> 00:16:41,360
Good point.

339
00:16:49,880 --> 00:16:50,500
Clay figures!

340
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:51,680
There are clay figures!

341
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:56,200
We must've behaved ourselves,

342
00:16:56,600 --> 00:17:00,360
so Master bought these for us.

343
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:03,080
Mine is so pretty!

344
00:17:03,360 --> 00:17:04,960
Mine is the strongest!

345
00:17:05,280 --> 00:17:06,360
No, mine is!

346
00:17:06,360 --> 00:17:07,520
Mine is stronger!

347
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:09,080
- Mine is the prettiest!
- Mine is stronger!

348
00:17:09,080 --> 00:17:10,500
No, mine is stronger!

349
00:17:10,500 --> 00:17:10,840
Mine is prettier!

350
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:12,680
Why aren't you eating?

351
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:13,920
If you don't hurry,

352
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:15,960
the abbot will eat everything!

353
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:24,880
He almost ate the rice bucket too.

354
00:17:32,160 --> 00:17:32,920
(Dragon-Subduing Arhat,)

355
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:34,760
(a catastrophe is coming to Lingshan.)

356
00:17:34,760 --> 00:17:36,600
(Buddha will be reborn as a mortal.)

357
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:39,720
(The fate of Buddhism rests with you.)

358
00:17:41,520 --> 00:17:42,200
Who could possibly force

359
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:44,400
even you to reincarnate, Master?

360
00:17:44,600 --> 00:17:45,840
If even you can't stop them,

361
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:47,520
then I

362
00:17:47,760 --> 00:17:48,920
stand even less of a chance.

363
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:52,800
(A Bodhisattva has guided
a Destined One)

364
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:54,080
(to come help you.)

365
00:17:54,360 --> 00:17:56,040
(Amitabha Buddha.)

366
00:17:56,040 --> 00:17:56,840
The Destined One?

367
00:17:57,200 --> 00:17:58,040
Who's the Destined One?

368
00:17:58,040 --> 00:17:58,720
Master?

369
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:02,880
Master?

370
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:04,600
Master!

371
00:18:19,480 --> 00:18:21,560
(I'm appointed by Buddha, Jade Emperor,
and Guanyin,)

372
00:18:21,560 --> 00:18:23,040
(special envoy for the scriptures,)

373
00:18:23,040 --> 00:18:24,520
(Monkey King of Shuilian Cave,
Huaguo Mountain,)

374
00:18:24,520 --> 00:18:26,840
(Great Sage Equaling Heaven,
Sun Wukong!)

375
00:18:27,120 --> 00:18:29,040
(Drop-dead handsome!)

376
00:18:31,280 --> 00:18:32,560
Mr. Drop-Dead!

377
00:18:38,320 --> 00:18:41,230
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

378
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:44,490
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

379
00:18:44,640 --> 00:18:48,290
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

380
00:18:48,340 --> 00:18:51,320
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

381
00:18:51,780 --> 00:18:58,530
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

382
00:18:58,550 --> 00:19:02,080
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

383
00:19:08,790 --> 00:19:11,990
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

384
00:19:12,020 --> 00:19:15,250
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

385
00:19:15,540 --> 00:19:18,560
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

386
00:19:18,570 --> 00:19:20,250
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

387
00:19:20,290 --> 00:19:22,170
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

388
00:19:22,210 --> 00:19:23,730
♪I left my wife behind♪

389
00:19:23,870 --> 00:19:25,330
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

390
00:19:25,370 --> 00:19:29,150
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

391
00:19:29,210 --> 00:19:30,290
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

392
00:19:30,300 --> 00:19:32,390
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

393
00:19:32,430 --> 00:19:34,090
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

394
00:19:34,130 --> 00:19:35,960
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

395
00:19:35,990 --> 00:19:39,320
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

396
00:19:39,360 --> 00:19:42,590
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

397
00:19:42,840 --> 00:19:45,720
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

398
00:19:45,740 --> 00:19:49,090
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

399
00:19:49,140 --> 00:19:52,750
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

400
00:19:52,800 --> 00:19:56,100
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

401
00:19:56,140 --> 00:19:59,210
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

402
00:19:59,790 --> 00:20:02,840
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

403
00:20:02,860 --> 00:20:06,280
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

404
00:20:06,320 --> 00:20:09,840
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

405
00:20:09,860 --> 00:20:13,320
♪You're just wasting your time♪

406
00:20:13,370 --> 00:20:16,290
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

407
00:20:16,340 --> 00:20:17,950
♪And I just laugh happily♪

408
00:20:17,980 --> 00:20:21,360
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

409
00:20:30,080 --> 00:20:33,640
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

410
